sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Người dùng
    participant API as API và lightweight router
    participant C as Query classifier/decomposer
    participant S as Shared SearchService
    participant E as Paired CLIP runtime
    participant Q as Qdrant
    participant PG as PostgreSQL metadata
    U->>API: Text hoặc explicit bounded constraint AST
    API->>C: NFC query, supported patterns, AND/OR grouping
    C-->>API: Original query, AST, uncertainty/limitations
    alt Unsupported relational pattern
        API-->>U: 409 UNSUPPORTED_RELATIONAL_QUERY
    else Strict required semantic leaf
        API-->>U: 409 VERIFIER_UNAVAILABLE
    else Supported retrieval hoặc safe fallback
        API->>S: Strategy, original query, filters và AST
        S->>E: Whole query và selected semantic phrases theo batch
        E-->>S: Same-space normalized vectors
        S->>Q: Single vector hoặc bounded multi-query fan-out
        Q-->>S: Actual candidates/ranks/cosines
        S->>S: UUID union/fusion và candidate cap
        S->>PG: Batch eligibility/metadata/tags
        PG-->>S: Metadata evidence, missing fields UNKNOWN
        S->>S: Required tri-state AND/OR, optional projection
        opt Rerank enabled
            S->>Q: Batch candidate vectors, digest checks
            S->>S: Whole/clause scores và evidence-aware ranking
        end
        S-->>API: Stable Top-K và constraint assessments
        API-->>U: Results, UNKNOWN warnings và route/version
    end
    Note over API,S: Ambiguous simple query giữ nguyên fast path, không LLM
